OL,3,CWales becomes first nation to withdraw
OL,4,Csupport for Fifa's Gianni Infantino
OL,6,FWales has become the first nation to
OL,7,Fwithdraw support for Fifa President
OL,8,FGianni Infantino's re-election bid,
OL,9,Ffollowing his attempt to sell off
OL,10,Fstakes in the World Cup to private
OL,11,Finvestors.
OL,13,FInfantino announced last week he was
OL,14,Fshelving the widely-denounced plan
OL,15,Fthat was rejected by three
OL,16,Fconfederations, with Uefa insisting
OL,17,Fits nations would boycott Fifa events.
OL,19,FDespite the U-turn, his decade-long
OL,20,Freign as the head of Fifa remains
OL,21,Funder intense scrutiny.
