OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785779367
OL,3,CWales becomes first nation to withdraw
OL,4,Csupport for Fifa's Gianni Infantino
OL,6,FOn Friday, Prime Minister Andy Burnham
OL,7,Fsaid that Infantino is the "wrong man"
OL,8,Fto lead Fifa, while the Football
OL,9,FAssociation called for a "full and
OL,10,Frobust review" into his leadership.
OL,12,FHe is due to stand for re-election in
OL,13,FMarch next year, but the Football
OL,14,FAssociation of Wales has now become
OL,15,Fthe first to officially remove its
OL,16,Fsupport for the Swiss.
