OL,3,CWales becomes first nation to withdraw
OL,4,Csupport for Fifa's Gianni Infantino
OL,6,FA FAW statement said: "The Football
OL,7,FAssociation of Wales hereby confirms
OL,8,Fits withdrawal of support for the
OL,9,Fcandidature of Mr Gianni Infantino,
OL,10,Ffor re-election as FIFA president for
OL,11,Fthe 2027`2031 term.
OL,13,F"The recent failures in good
OL,14,Fgovernance, processes, leadership,
OL,15,Fvalues, stakeholder management,
OL,16,Fcommunications and sound judgement
OL,17,Fhave led us to a position where Mr
OL,18,FInfantino has lost the confidence of
OL,19,Fthe FAW to remain at the helm of world
OL,20,Ffootball.
OL,26,@nD@WOUuD@AOU
